    Energy Weapon is Energy Pistol or Energy Rifle. Hand to Hand: Expert
    "cannot be changed" is hand_to_hand costs {}.
  - RELATED: six plus two at levels 3, 5, 8 and 11. "Pilot: Any (+5% to
    horsemanship only)" is Pilot with no bonus plus the catalog''s
    Horsemanship category at +5 (the catalog files riding skills there;
    Amazon/psi-druid precedent). "Technical: Any (+10 to language and lore
    skills only)" is Technical with no bonus: the +10% applies to a name
    family (Language:/Lore:) of about 40 Technical rows, so it is in the
    related note rather than a second enumerated entry - NOT STORED as a
    bonus. "Military: Find Contraband (+5%) only", "Science: Basic Math only
    (+10%)" (catalog Mathematics: Basic) and "Medical: First aid only" are
    only-lists. Physical except Boxing. Cowboy, Electrical, Mechanical,
    Pilot Related and Wilderness: none.
  - SECONDARY: four from the same list and limits, no bonuses.
  - TAKES NO O.C.C.: the book prints a full R.C.C. package and names no
    occupation; there is no key for "no occupation", so it is a restriction
